@startuml
!include theme.puml
hide footbox
autonumber
queue Kafka
participant Consumer
database "SQLite lokal" as db
Consumer -> Kafka : fetch group sendiri
Kafka --> Consumer : envelope
alt valid dan efek berhasil
Consumer -> db : apply versi / marker dedup
db --> Consumer : durable
Consumer -> Kafka : commit offset
else record valid tetapi dependensi gagal setelah retry
Consumer -> Consumer : berhenti tanpa commit\nsupervisor memulai ulang untuk retry
else record invalid
Consumer -> Kafka : publish DLQ beserta metadata
Kafka --> Consumer : ACK DLQ
Consumer -> Kafka : commit offset asal
end
note over Consumer,db
Notifier: send alert, lalu marker.
Crash di antaranya dapat menggandakan alert.
end note
@enduml
